          {
            "title": "Match Runtime Failures",
            "id": 152093,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Operasi dan handler mana yang dipasangkan dengan benar?</p><selection iscode=\"true\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>10 / 0 → ZeroDivisionError</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>10 + \"2\" → ValueError</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>data[\"missing\"] → TypeError</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>10 / 0 → ZeroDivisionError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Operasi dan handler mana yang dipasangkan dengan benar?</p><selection iscode=\"true\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>10 / 0 → ZeroDivisionError</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>10 + \"2\" → ValueError</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>data[\"missing\"] → TypeError</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Baik <code>10 / 0 → ZeroDivisionError</code> maupun <code>10 + \"2\" → ValueError</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>10 / 0 → ZeroDivisionError</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the Zero Handler",
            "id": 152094,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi handler kedua untuk jumlah tamu <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"bill.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"48\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"guests = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  share = total / guests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" TypeError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Use numbers&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ZeroDivisionError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Add a guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Add a guest\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>ZeroDivisionError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi handler kedua untuk jumlah tamu <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"bill.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"48\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"guests = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  share = total / guests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" TypeError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Use numbers&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ZeroDivisionError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Add a guest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Add a guest\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>/</code>, diikuti oleh <code>ZeroDivisionError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Keep Specific Handlers First",
            "id": 152095,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang benar tentang kode ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid value&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Other failure&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Respons yang disesuaikan tetap dapat dijangkau, sedangkan fallback berada di urutan terakhir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Respons yang disesuaikan tetap dapat dijangkau dan fallback ditambahkan terlebih dahulu</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Respons yang disesuaikan tetap dapat diakses dan tidak memiliki fallback</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Respons yang disesuaikan tetap dapat dijangkau, sedangkan fallback berada di urutan terakhir.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Handler ini mengikuti blok <code>try</code>. Jika blok itu memunculkan <code>ValueError</code>, pesan mana yang dicetak?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Invalid value&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Other failure&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hanya Invalid value.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya Other failure.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Invalid value, lalu Other failure.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada pesan karena handler bare tidak boleh mengikuti handler spesifik.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hanya Invalid value.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Catch Missing Data",
            "id": 152096,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi handler kedua untuk key <code>\"role\"</code> yang hilang.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"profile.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"record = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  role = record[\" /><text value=\"&quot;role&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing field&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Missing field\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>KeyError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Coba baca field yang tidak ada dan tangani error key yang hilang.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"profile.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"record = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  role = record[\" /><text value=\"&quot;role&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" KeyError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Missing field&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;name&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"ValueError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Missing field\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"role\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>KeyError</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Capture Error Details",
            "id": 152097,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Menangkap exception konversi dalam variabel <code>error</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"price.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"price_text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;free&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  price = float(price_text)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError \" /><text value=\"as\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" error:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Price failed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"as message\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"as details\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Price failed\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>as error</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Menangkap exception konversi dalam variabel <code>error</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"price.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"price_text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;free&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  price = float(price_text)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError \" /><text value=\"as\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" error:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Price failed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"as message\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"as details\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Price failed\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>ValueError</code>, diikuti oleh <code>as error</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
