            "id": 152098,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ketik variabel yang ditangkap di dalam <code>print()</code> untuk menampilkan pesan exception.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"quantity.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"quantity_text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;many&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  quantity = int(quantity_text)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError \" /><text value=\"as\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" error:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(error)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"101\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"invalid literal for int() with base 10: 'many'\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>error</code>.</p></body></html>"
